============================================================
Step 5: Physical interpretation of generators
============================================================
  Each generator is a direction in log-space along which Pi is preserved.
  Physically: simultaneous rescaling of variables that keeps the
  normalised enthalpy Pi (and therefore the pore fraction) invariant.

  Generator 1:
    P x exp(-0.201*eps), V x exp(+0.336*eps), A x exp(+0.886*eps), rho x exp(-0.058*eps), Lv x exp(-0.142*eps), dT x exp(+0.149*eps), Pr x exp(+0.106*eps)
    Meaning: increase A while decrease P, increase V, decrease rho, decrease Lv, increase dT, increase Pr
             to keep Pi (and pore fraction) unchanged

  Generator 2:
    V x exp(+0.197*eps), rho x exp(+0.975*eps), Lv x exp(-0.066*eps)
    Meaning: increase rho while increase V, decrease Lv
             to keep Pi (and pore fraction) unchanged

  Generator 3:
    P x exp(+0.233*eps), V x exp(+0.209*eps), k x exp(+0.946*eps)
    Meaning: increase k while increase P, increase V
             to keep Pi (and pore fraction) unchanged

  Generator 4:
    P x exp(+0.143*eps), V x exp(+0.494*eps), A x exp(-0.052*eps), rho x exp(-0.061*eps), k x exp(-0.101*eps), Lv x exp(+0.839*eps), dT x exp(+0.073*eps), Pe_vap x exp(+0.069*eps), Pr x exp(+0.051*eps)
    Meaning: increase Lv while increase P, increase V, decrease A, decrease rho, decrease k, increase dT, increase Pe_vap, increase Pr
             to keep Pi (and pore fraction) unchanged

  Generator 5:
    P x exp(+0.238*eps), V x exp(-0.443*eps), A x exp(+0.143*eps), rho x exp(+0.075*eps), k x exp(+0.067*eps), Lv x exp(+0.184*eps), dT x exp(+0.813*eps), Pr x exp(-0.133*eps)
    Meaning: increase dT while increase P, decrease V, increase A, increase rho, increase k, increase Lv, decrease Pr
             to keep Pi (and pore fraction) unchanged

  Generator 6:
    V x exp(-0.119*eps), gamma x exp(+0.991*eps)
    Meaning: increase gamma while decrease V
             to keep Pi (and pore fraction) unchanged

  Generator 7:
    P x exp(-0.185*eps), A x exp(-0.055*eps), dT x exp(+0.069*eps), Tb x exp(+0.976*eps)
    Meaning: increase Tb while decrease P, decrease A, increase dT
             to keep Pi (and pore fraction) unchanged

  Generator 8:
    P x exp(-0.156*eps), V x exp(-0.143*eps), Pe_vap x exp(+0.975*eps)
    Meaning: increase Pe_vap while decrease P, decrease V
             to keep Pi (and pore fraction) unchanged

